    content: "Trauma = overwhelm + helplessness. Window of tolerance = optimal arousal zone. Hyperarousal (above window: anxiety, rage) vs hypoarousal (below window: numb, collapsed). Titration = small doses of activation + resolution. Pendulation = natural oscillation between distress + resources. Anchor = resource (safe place, supportive person, body sensation). Slowing down = key to trauma work. Less is more. Don't abreact (relive) — titrate.",
